### Register a new user (SUCCESS)
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@email.com"
}

###

### Register same user again (ERROR - already exists)
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@email.com"
}

###

### Register user with invalid email (ERROR - validation)
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "invalid-email"
}
